 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? Totally normal feeling. Want to try one thing on yourself before you go? You can usually rent them if you ask at the front. If not, walking is fine. Want to wear nice but simple something you feel good in? If you overdo it, people will think you' trying too hard. Most people do end up looking like themselves. Stick to basic ones you know how to pronounce. If something looks too difficult, ask for an affitudo version. Yes, it' a great way to try something new without feeling pressured. Also, ask about any ingredients that concern you. Many restaurants now have gluten free and dairy free options too.",
